; 39C: the dais is the one ground skin in the realm WITH a collider, because it is the one that is
; meant to be climbed rather than walked over. 0.3 m, inside StepUp.MaxHeight (0.5) and exactly on
; the navmesh's agent_max_climb (0.3 — one voxel), so the player and every NPC reach it by the same
; rule. ⚠️ A RAISED SKIN ANY TALLER THAN THIS IS PLAYER-ONLY GROUND: the step-up would carry the
; player up it and the bake would refuse to path an NPC after them.
[sub_resource type="BoxShape3D" id="Shape_salt_steps"]
size = Vector3(11, 0.3, 10)

[sub_resource type="BoxShape3D" id="Shape_well"]
size = Vector3(1.5, 2.75, 2.25)

[sub_resource type="BoxShape3D" id="Shape_belltower"]
