; --- Braziers. The ember accent: a coal ball with an emissive material, a warm OmniLight softer and
; --- shorter-ranged than a lamp's, a fistful of rising motes, and a crackle emitter. Two flank the
; --- north threshold and one stands at the plaza. Three, not six — ART_STYLE §7 wants the accent
; --- findable in a vista, never dominant in it.

