; Banners. Two flank the threshold and one stands at the head of the west row. Signs only — no
; colliders, because a banner the player bumps into is a wall pretending to be cloth.
; ⚠️ NOTHING STANDS IN THE SPINE. The first draft of this pass put the market's own banner dead centre
; at (0, 0, -21) — a 1.9 x 3.4 m sign, with no collider, in the middle of the only route in. It looked
; like a gate and behaved like fog. Both threshold banners are now at x = ±4.3, outside the 7 m aisle.

