; --- The notice board: this district's one new interactable, and 38K's answer to a place with nothing
; --- to say. Same shape as town_hub's GuildMarker (banner mesh + collider + DialogueComponent).
; ⚠️ An entity gets ONE interactable — EntityNode.GetComponent<T> returns the first child match — so the
; board carries a DialogueComponent and nothing else, forever.
; ⚠️ No choice in dialogue.market_board carries an Effect. A notice board that started a quest would put
; market gossip in the journal, which is the failure 38Q's brief already names.

