; ── THE ANNEXE (Phase 42B) ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
; The Veiled Archive's hub, on the market's north side on Area_market_timber (centre (3, 16.5),
; radius (7, 4.5), levelled to y = 0). One low storey with its door facing -Z, back down the market:
; a reading room among the timber yards, not a hall. The Archive has no shopfront on purpose.
; ⚠️ Its great library is Sunspire's and is Phase 44's — see the 42B retrospective for the handoff.
